WEBVTT

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.070
Excuse me!

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:43.680
So, this is your room.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.620
It's really clean.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.840
Huh? Are you sure? If you say so.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.610
Thanks. I feel refreshed now.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:59.570
Your shirt is really big.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.060
Do you live here alone?

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.620
That's nice.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:12.860
Hey. I'll pay you back.

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:16.070
What do you want me to do?

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.280
A model for your art?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:28.310
Here? Is it okay if I go in?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.930
So, this is your atelier.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.850
It's really organized.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.680
Don't I have to take everything off?

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.570
Really?

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.640
This?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.020
I don't know how to pose.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:55.920
It's hard to just pose "like normal."

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.150
I'm just going to sit still.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.910
Hey. Are you sure you don't want to have sex?

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:15.600
You really are weird.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.650
Are you not interested in me?

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:20.090
Or are you not interested in girls?

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.780
I see.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.780
But maybe that's normal.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.060
I don't really know.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.520
I think it's okay.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.190
Everyone's different.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.950
Sure. You can ask me anything.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.850
My hobby? What's my hobby?

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:57.810
Movies and shopping.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:02.090
I like having tea too. And chatting in cafes.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.650
Guys always want to fool around.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.970
So it's easier being with girls.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.780
When we're eating dessert and talking,

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.440
time goes by so fast.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.570
My dream?

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.740
My dream...

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.950
I sort of have one and I sort of don't.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.550
A TV personality? I could never do that!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:32.830
They're really amazing.
They laugh and talk for other people.

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:37.180
Hey. Do you spend all day

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.460
drawing pictures every day?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.610
Replicas?

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:45.190
You can make money with that?

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.100
That's amazing.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.660
That's not true. Even if it's a counterfeit,

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:55.410
as long as the viewer thinks it's real,

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:57.270
that's amazing.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.070
We're done for the day?
Then I'm going home.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.040
Are you mad?

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:15.540
Oh, really? Good.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.440
I'll come again.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:34.030
All I have to do is sit here,

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:37.000
but still, even that's pretty hard.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.770
No. I'm fine.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.990
Is this your first time? To draw someone?

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:51.200
Hey. Why did you want to draw me?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.350
You don't know?

00:05:58.100 --> 00:05:59.670
Well...

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.060
There's a lot of things I don't understand either.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.830
I don't need that.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:20.370
You let me into your room.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:23.120
I'm paying you back by being your model.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:27.340
If that's not how it is, I'm not coming here anymore.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.550
Hey. Do you know what love is?

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.950
I see. So, you don't know.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.480
Well, you are all alone.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.440
Huh? I want to know.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.900
I want to know what love is.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.130
I don't understand.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:15.300
Even when someone says they love me,
or when we get intimate,

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.120
I don't feel anything.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.640
Something's always missing. I'm never satisfied.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:25.550
I'm incomplete. That's why I want to know.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.760
I want to know love and feel satisfied.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.240
You're cheering for me?

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.020
Thanks!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.070
When are you going to finish your drawing?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.300
Soon? Let me see.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:56.800
Wow. That's amazing.

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:01.160
Though, I'm not that pretty.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:06.000
So, this is what I look like to you.

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:10.020
Really?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.360
It'll be finished soon.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.650
Sorry! I had nowhere else to go!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.570
This girl?

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:36.430
This girl is my...

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.890
I'm not really sure.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.810
But when I'm with her, I feel warm

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.680
and soft.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:48.880
I wish I could hold her forever.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.020
My face?

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.050
I don't know what you mean.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.570
Hey. Can we come in?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.410
Thanks.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.540
Can I borrow a towel?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:13.550
And I want to give her a bath.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.340
Get out of the way!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:58.610
I think I understand now, thanks to you.

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.650
This is the first time I've ever

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:03.220
gone so far for someone.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.770
I thought I'd never feel satisfied.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.410
But I've finally found it.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.820
I understand now.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.860
I know what this feeling is called.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:23.990
Thank you.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.940
No! It's dangerous, Hida! Don't go!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.550
What if you fall in love with Shio-chan?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.480
What am I doing?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.690
I'm going home.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.360
I ran out of my house when I saw

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.280
Matsuzaka's message.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.200
What is she up to?

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:09.330
Did she really capture Shio-chan?

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.300
But why?

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:14.250
I don't understand. I don't understand,

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.640
but I bet the reason she keeps coming to my house

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:21.510
is because she heard about me from Shio-chan.

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.640
This feels dangerous.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.400
What am I doing?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.070
Sorry, Mom. Sorry.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.950
I'm going to stop.

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.120
I'm going to become normal.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.100
I'm going to face it!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.000
I'm going to face the trauma!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.710
Hey, you.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.150
Oh, sorry to surprise you.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:08.260
You were acting weird.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.560
Are you okay?

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.440
Wait!

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.830
No! No! No! No! No!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.030
Help me! Anyone!

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.460
I'm going to

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.460
stop getting involved.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.960
As long as I have this, I can go on.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.610
I'm going to go to school

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.430
with this in my pocket.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:51.990
I have to get over my fear of girls.
I'm going to start working.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.890
With this in my pocket.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.820
And I'm going to become normal,

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:58.450
graduate, and go to work.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.870
I'm going to become a respectable adult.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:02.860
With this in my pocket.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.070
You want to see Shio-chan?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.920
Matsuzaka.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.550
Let's be friends

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:28.990
from work again tomorrow, like always.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.870
What's wrong?

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:45.690
Sorry. I forgot to bring bread today. I'll go buy some.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.130
No. Hold on.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.370
You're crying. You don't have to go now.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:56.760
How did you know? You didn't look at my face.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.310
Mitsuboshi, it's been a while.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:07.310
I was worried about you.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:10.590
I wanted to see you.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.780
Shio-chan is cute, right?

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:19.490
She really is like an angel.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:22.330
Her soft hair like a cat.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.370
Her soft cheeks.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.940
Her soft, smooth skin.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.030
It's really amazing.

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.950
She's so cute. I can't control myself.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:36.710
Hey.

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:40.040
You're in love with Shio-chan, right?

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.250
Are you jealous?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.550
What is this? What is this?

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.270
What is this?

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:53.440
Thanks for not telling the police.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:56.680
You wanted to be able to see Shio-chan again.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:01.200
I know you'd do anything for Shio-chan.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:04.120
That's why I want to ask you.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:07.080
Shio-chan is really happy right now.

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:11.360
But there's someone who's trying to destroy it.
Mitsuboshi,

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.090
can you help me get rid of that person?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.280
What?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.500
If you do that, I'll let you see Shio-chan.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.050
You want to see her, right?

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:25.840
You want to hear her say,
"Good boy," right?

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:29.670
You're going to be Shio-chan's knight in shining armor.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:34.140
I'd never do it!
I've decided to become a decent person!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:37.740
I don't care about Shio-chan anymore! That's right!
I don't care anymore!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:40.390
I don't want things to get any crazier!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:44.440
Your problems are none of my business!
It's none of my business!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:48.020
So, just leave me alone--

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.130
A sock she just took off.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.660
Do you know whose it is?

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.600
It smells like milk.

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:03.040
An angel!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.850
I'm being purified!

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:11.460
She's divine!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.520
Angel Shio Koube!

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.930
I'd do anything for you.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:20.450
I'd do anything to be touched by you!

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:25.870
I'll do anything!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.360
Thanks.

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:34.950
I hurt my friend.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:38.840
She was really important to me.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:42.140
I wanted to protect our bond.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:46.500
But I rejected her when it really mattered.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.670
I shouldn't have tried so hard.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:54.340
I shouldn't have stopped halfway.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:58.800
Then I could have still been having fun with her now.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.810
I can't take it anymore.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.480
I don't deserve to be alive.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.810
I wish I just disappeared.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.320
Stop!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.420
Kind people always blame themselves.

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.820
That's why they shatter.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:20.050
You tried hard. You were brave.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:22.800
Don't try to erase yourself.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:27.420
I think you're amazing. And I respect you.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.710
So...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.750
Good girl. There, there.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.150
Sorry.

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.220
No! It's okay. It's just...

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.160
You're the one who's trying hard.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:49.480
You're always posting flyers. You never give up.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.660
That's all I have.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:56.830
Hey! You should have more confidence in yourself!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.360
You gave me courage.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.740
Thanks.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.350
I wish this world

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.310
was a place where

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:16.670
kind people were rewarded for their kindness.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.680
In other words... Is this what you mean?

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:23.100
There's a guy searching for Shio-chan
and trying to take her away.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.930
And you want to do something about it. Right?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.600
That's right.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:33.290
I don't want to interact with him.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.130
I said, "Get rid of him,"

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.030
but I don't want to do anything violent.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.880
Yeah.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.200
I want you to get him to go somewhere far away.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:52.260
Somewhere far away from here.
Where it's hard to look for her.

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.680
Like the next prefecture over. That's realistic.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:58.970
I think Matsuzaka is superior to others.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:01.520
She's smart and calm.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.780
And very beautiful.

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.640
Why is someone like her...?

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.280
I don't understand.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:13.450
You could choose to have a normal happy life.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.230
Why are you so set on Shio-chan?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:22.710
You can understand, right?

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:25.530
You understand that I don't know the reason.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.800
The only thing I understand is the result, not the reason.

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:32.120
My heart reacted to Shio-chan.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:36.100
I wanted to touch her. I wanted to hug her.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.690
She made me happy.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:42.430
She made me feel true happiness.

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:45.850
You must understand, right?

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.510
Right?

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:55.270
Shio-chan is an angel. That's not just a guess.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.860
It's a given!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.360
But angels are weak and frail.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.090
That's why we have to protect them

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:07.280
from the dirty world.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.000
What do I get if I help you?

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:16.010
I told you, right?

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:20.180
The knight will earn the right to see the angel.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:24.940
But if you help out even more, I'm sure the angel

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:27.010
would be happy.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.110
Taiyo!

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.350
Good boy! Good boy!

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:40.440
Okay.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.970
I'm counting on you, knight!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.580
Shio.

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.520
Here.

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:00.880
I'm okay.

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:10.760
Yes? Hello?

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.970
Yes. About the flyers?

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.820
Yes.

00:22:14.820 --> 00:22:17.100
I get a lot of prank calls.

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.790
I'm tired. Can you tell me about your information

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:22.030
before we meet?

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:26.990
A clue?

00:23:57.800 --> 00:24:01.800
Shio-chan, thanks for being with me.

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:05.060
Our love will shine even brighter.

00:24:05.060 --> 00:24:08.590
Forever. In this cage.

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:12.010
9th Life: Dissolving Rain.
